      "aspect": "Advanced Project Overview and Reporting",
      "claim": "While effective for individual task tracking, getting a consolidated, high-level overview or generating complex reports across multiple distinct translation projects might require workarounds or external tools, adding friction for a freelancer managing diverse client work.",
      "basis_ids": []
    },
    {
      "aspect": "Specialized AI for Linguistic Tasks",
      "claim": "Trello's general AI features for text refinement and summarization might not fully meet the specialized needs of a linguistic freelancer, potentially falling short compared to expectations or more advanced linguistic tools.",
      "basis_ids": [
        "D:Trello:features:3",
        "D:Trello:features:5",
